repository-code: 'https://github.com/erling6232/imagedata'
url: 'https://imagedata.readthedocs.io/'
abstract: >-
  Imagedata is a python library to read and write medical
  image data into numpy arrays. Imagedata will handle
  multi-dimensional data. In particular, imagedata will read
  and sort DICOM 3D and 4D series based on defined tags.
  Imagedata will handle geometry information between the
  formats.
